  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Emergency life-saving Health, Nutrition, WASH and Protection support for vulnerable populations affected by adverse effects of Deyr floods in South Central Somalia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme aims to deliver an integrated package of health, nutrition, WASH, and protection services to 24,620 beneficiaries in Dollow District, including 12,802 females and 11,818 males. The programme is aligned with Tr&#xf3;caire&#x2019;s broader strategy of responding to crises through a multi-sectoral approach that combines immediate humanitarian assistance with long-term development interventions.</narrative>
  </description>
